  "verdict": "REFUTED at the coherent operating point: at identical bits the low-rank operator is 2.80x the output error of flat q3 on every tensor tested. It does reduce operations (0.203x the dense MACs), but the acceptance requires reducing bytes AND operations while preserving function, and function is not preserved.",
